  "affiliationText": "Communication is a B.S. offered through the Department of Communication in CALS. The major requires ~31 credits of Communication coursework: a Foundations sequence, a Data Literacy sequence (research methods + one statistics course), three Core Communication courses, four upper-level COMM electives (3100+), and one COMM 3000-3099 practicum. All major requirements must be taken for a letter grade (no F). Minimum 120 credits overall, at least 55 from CALS, and at least 100 letter-graded.",
